+function renderCombat(){const c=game.combat,s=game.state;app.innerHTML=`${topbar()}<div class="eyebrow">FLOOR ${s.floor} · FIELD ENCOUNTER</div><h1 class="title" style="font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,40px);margin-top:7px">The fight is real.</h1><p class="subtitle">Read the enemy’s tell before you commit. Strong attacks cost SP; a well-timed defense can create an opening.</p><div class="layout"><section class="main-col"><div class="panel"><div class="panel-heading">COMBAT ENCOUNTER <b>${c.boss?'BOSS · PHASE '+c.phase:'DANGER'}</b></div><div class="combat-status"><div><div class="bar-label"><span>YOUR HP</span><span>${s.hp} / ${s.maxHp}</span></div><div class="bar"><span style="width:${100*s.hp/s.maxHp}%"></span></div><div class="bar-label"><span>YOUR SP</span><span>${s.sp} / ${s.maxSp}</span></div><div class="bar sp"><span style="width:${100*s.sp/s.maxSp}%"></span></div></div><div><div class="bar-label"><span>${esc(c.name.toUpperCase())} HP</span><span>${Math.max(0,c.hp)} / ${c.maxHp}</span></div><div class="enemy-bar"><span style="width:${Math.max(0,100*c.hp/c.maxHp)}%"></span></div><div class="subtle" style="margin-top:8px">${c.boss?`MULTI-PHASE BOSS · PHASE ${c.phase}`:'FIELD MONSTER'} · TURN ${c.turn+1}</div></div></div><div class="enemy-card"><div class="enemy-name">${esc(c.name)}</div><div class="enemy-desc">${enemyDescription(c.name)}<br><b style="color:#e19484">Tell:</b> ${esc(c.telegraph)}</div></div><div class="combat-actions"><button class="action-btn primary" onclick="combatAction('attack')">ATTACK <span class="subtle">No cost</span></button><button class="action-btn" onclick="combatAction('sword')" ${s.sp<10?'disabled':''}>SWORD SKILL <span class="subtle">10 SP</span></button><button class="action-btn" onclick="combatAction('dodge')">DODGE <span class="subtle">evade</span></button><button class="action-btn" onclick="combatAction('parry')">PARRY <span class="subtle">timing</span></button><button class="action-btn" onclick="combatAction('guard')">GUARD <span class="subtle">reduce dmg</span></button><button class="action-btn" onclick="combatAction('counter')">COUNTER <span class="subtle">read tell</span></button><button class="action-btn" onclick="combatAction('special')" ${s.sp<18?'disabled':''}>SPECIAL <span class="subtle">18 SP</span></button><button class="action-btn" onclick="command('INVENTORY')">ITEM <span class="subtle">use potion</span></button><button class="action-btn" onclick="fleeCombat()">RETREAT <span class="subtle">surrender ground</span></button></div><div class="combat-log">${esc(c.log)}</div>${s.hp<=0?`<div class="dead-overlay">HP has reached zero. The world blurs at its edges. There is no respawn screen. Your save remains at this encounter; choose LOAD to return to the last saved state, or accept a costly recovery event to continue the AU.</div><button class="secondary-btn" style="margin-top:10px" onclick="recoverFromDeath()">ACCEPT AU RECOVERY (LOSE COL + GEAR DURABILITY)</button>`:''}</div><div class="panel"><div class="panel-heading">TACTICAL NOTE <b>READ THE TELL</b></div><p class="side-copy">A lunging enemy can be dodged; a committed attack can be parried. Guard is dependable but slow. Counters reward a correct read and punish a wrong one.</p><div class="command-row"><button class="command-btn" onclick="command('STATUS')">STATUS</button><button class="command-btn" onclick="command('SAVE')">SAVE</button></div></div></section><aside class="side-col"><div class="panel side-panel"><div class="panel-heading">PLAYER STATUS <b>LV ${s.level}</b></div>${statusBars()}<div class="stat-list"><div class="stat-line"><span>WEAPON</span><b>${esc(s.weapon)} · +${s.weaponDamage}</b></div><div class="stat-line"><span>DEFENCE</span><b>${s.def}</b></div><div class="stat-line"><span>PROFICIENCY</span><b>${s.proficiency}%</b></div><div class="stat-line"><span>SKILL MASTERY</span><b>${s.mastery}%</b></div></div></div><div class="panel side-panel"><div class="panel-heading">PARTY <b>${s.party.length?'READY':'SOLO'}</b></di