 are turn-based: enemy tells matter. Guard, evade, and strike at the right moment.</p></div></aside></div>`}
function creationStep(){const d=game.draft;if(game.step===0)return `<h2 class="section-title">Who are you?</h2><p class="side-copy">A new face in a crowded starting city. Your name and look are yours to decide.</p><div class="field-grid" style="margin-top:17px"><div class="field"><label for="cname">Player name *</label><input id="cname" maxlength="24" placeholder="Name" value="${esc(d.name)}"></div><div class="field"><label for="age">Age</label><input id="age" type="number" min="13" max="99" value="${esc(d.age)}"></div><div class="field"><label for="gender">Gender</label><select id="gender">${['Unspecified','Woman','Man','Non-binary'].map(x=>`<option ${d.gender===x?'selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label for="appearance">Appearance</label><input id="appearance" maxlength="90" placeholder="A detail people notice…" value="${esc(d.appearance)}"></div></div><div class="btn-row"><button class="primary-btn" onclick="nextCreation()">CONTINUE　→</button></div>`;
if(game.step===1)return `<h2 class="section-title">What drives you?</h2><p class="side-copy">Your past informs your first instincts, but it does not decide who you become.</p><div class="field-grid" style="margin-top:17px"><div class="field"><label>Personality</label><select id="personality">${['Cautiously curious','Quietly determined','Warm and sociable','Wry and observant','Restless and bold','Thoughtful and reserved'].map(x=>`<option ${d.personality===x?'selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label>Background</label><select id="background">${['A first-day player','A careful beta tester','A solo-minded wanderer','A longtime gamer','A newcomer to games','A friend of a friend'].map(x=>`<option ${d.background===x?'selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field full"><label>One thing you hope to find</label><input id="hope" maxlength="80" placeholder="A reason to keep going…" value="${esc(d.hope||'')}"></div></div><div class="btn-row"><button class="secondary-btn" onclick="prevCreation()">← BACK</button><button class="primary-btn" onclick="nextCreation()">CONTINUE　→</button></div>`;
return `<h2 class="section-title">Choose your first weapon.</h2><p class="side-copy">Every weapon has a different rhythm. You are still a beginner: skill comes from practice, not from a menu.</p><div class="field-grid" style="margin-top:17px"><div class="field full"><label>Weapon</label><select id="weapon">${['One-handed sword','Rapier','Dagger','Two-handed axe','Spear','Mace'].map(x=>`<option ${d.weapon===x?'selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field full"><label>Combat style</label><select id="style">${['Balanced','Quick and evasive','Patient and defensive','Direct and forceful','Precise and tactical'].map(x=>`<option ${d.style===x?'selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select></div></div><div class="intro-note"><span class="note-icon">⚔</span><span><b>${esc(d.weapon)}</b> • ${esc(d.style)}<br>You begin with starter gear, 100 HP, and no mastered Sword Skills.</span></div><div class="btn-row"><button class="secondary-btn" onclick="prevCreation()">← BACK</button><button class="primary-btn" onclick="beginGame()">ENTER AINCRAD　✦</button></div>`}
function collectStep(){const val=id=>document.getElementById(id)?.value; if(game.step===0){game.draft.name=val('cname')?.trim()||'';game.draft.age=Math.max(13,Math.min(99,Number(val('age'))||18));game.draft.gender=val('gender');game.draft.appearance=val('appearance')?.trim()||'';}else if(game.step===1){game.draft.personality=val('personality');game.draft.background=val('background');game.draft.hope=val('hope')?.trim()||'';}else{game.draft.weapon=val('weapon');game.draft.style=val('style')}}
function nextCreation(){collectStep();if(game.step===0&&!game.draft.name){toast('Choose a player name to continue.');document.getElementById('cname')?.focus();return}game.step=Math.min(2,game.step+1);render()}
function prevCreation(){collectStep();game.step=Math.max(0,game.step-1);render()}
function beginGame(){collectStep();const name=game.draft.name.trim();if(!name){game.step=0;render();toast('Choose a player name first.');return}const weaponStats={'One-handed sword':{str:5,agi:5,damage:7},Rapier:{str:4,agi:7,damage:6},Dagger:{str:4,agi:8,damage:5},'Two-handed axe':{str:8,agi:3,damage:9},Spear:{str:6,agi:5,damage:7},Mace:{str:7,agi:4,damage:8}};const w=weaponStats[game.draft.weapon];game.state={name,profile:{...game.draft},floor:1,level:1,exp:0,nextExp:40,hp:100,maxHp:100,sp:35,maxSp:35,str:10+w.str,agi:10+w.agi,vit:10,dex:10,def:5,proficiency:0,mastery:0,weaponDamage:w.damage,weapon:game.draft.weapon,armor:'Traveler’s Tunic',armorDef:2,inventory:[{name:'Healing Potion',type:'consumable',count:3,info:'Restores 35 HP.'},{name:'Minor SP Tonic',type:'consumable',count:2,info:'Restores 18 SP.'},{name:'Field Rations',type:'consumable',count:2,info:'A simple meal for the road.'}],col:120,quests:[{id:'first-steps',title:'Aincrad: First Steps',desc:'Reach the outer field and learn to survive. Defeat one monster.',state:'Active',reward:'25 EXP · 40 Col'}],journal:['November 6, 2022 — I logged into Sword Art Online for launch day.','The mirror event stripped away my avatar disguise. I am now trapped in my own face.'],relationships:{'Kirito':0,'Asuna':0,'Klein':0,'Agil':0},guild:null,party:[],flags:{intro:true,monsterDefeated:0,seenFloor:{},bosses:[],death:false},turn:0,location:'Starting City',storyKey:'opening',event:'THE FIRST DAY',battleLog:'',decisions:[]};game.mode='story';persist();render()}
function scene(){const s=game.state;const loc=floors[s.floor-1][0];s.location=loc;if(s.storyKey==='opening')return {title:'THE FIRST DAY',label:'NOVEMBER 6, 2022 · FLOOR 1',text:`I remember the way the light caught the rooftops of the Starting City. Ten thousand of us stood beneath the floating castle, laughing, testing the menus, pretending the world beyond the plaza was just another game.\n\nThen the sky turned the color of blood. A colossal figure in a red hood appeared above the city. The system menu vanished from my sight.\n\n“Players of Sword Art Online. I welcome you to my world.” Akihiko Kayaba’s voice was calm, impossibly clear. “You may have noticed that the logout button has disappeared. This is not a malfunction.”\n\nAround me, voices rose into panic. Someone fell to their knees. A black-haired player near the edge of the crowd—Kirito, I’d later learn—was already watching the exits, calculating. A red-haired girl stood rigid, eyes fixed on the sky. “If we clear all one hundred floors,” Kayaba continued, “you will be freed. If your HP reaches zero here, your NerveGear will destroy your brain in the real world.”\n\nMy hand found the plain ${esc(s.weapon).toLowerCase()} at my side. It felt suddenly, terribly real. What I do next is mine to choose.`,choices:['Push through the crowd toward the city gate. I need space to think.','Look for the red-haired player; she seems as shocked as I am.','Find the black-haired solo player and ask what he knows.','Stay close to the plaza. Help someone who is panicking.']};
if(s.storyKey==='afterIntro')return {title:'A CITY OF STRANGERS',label:'STARTING CITY · DAY ONE',text:`The plaza does not empty all at once. It fractures—some sprint toward the gate, others cling together beneath Kayaba’s fading image. The castle hangs above us, impossibly vast.\n\nI have a basic weapon, a few starter supplies, and no real idea how to use either. My profile calls me “${esc(s.profile.personality)},” but that does not make the fear smaller. The outer fields begin just beyond the city walls. Somewhere out there, the first monsters are waiting.\n\nI overhear a cheerful voice trying to rally a group near the fountain. “Name’s Klein! If we’re stuck in here, we might as well stick together!” A few steps away, Kirito is already moving toward the gate alone. The red-haired player has disappeared into the crowd.`,choices:['Approach Klein and offer to join his group.','Head for the gate and test my weapon alone.','Visit the item stalls before leaving the safe zone.','Ask the crowd if anyone knows where the red-haired player went.']};
if(s.storyKey==='firstField')return {title:'THE VERDANT PLAINS',label:'FLOOR 1 · OUTER FIELD',text:`Outside the city, the grass rolls beneath a sky that looks too perfect to be kind. The safe-zone boundary glimmers behind me. A Grey Wolf pads between the low hills, ears angled toward the path. Its red HP bar hangs above its head.\n\nI remember the warning: this is not a game anymore. I can retreat to the city if I need to, but the road forward will not open itself. A few players are visible in the distance; none close enough to save me from a bad decision.\n\nThe wolf has noticed me. It lowers its shoulders, preparing to lunge.`,choices:['Engage carefully. Watch its shoulders and look for an opening.','Keep distance and study its movement before committing.','Retreat to the safe zone. I’m not ready for a fight.']};
if(s.storyKey==='ending')return {title:'THE CASTLE FALLS',label:'AINCRAD · FLOOR 100',text:`I stand beneath the final sky. The long climb across one hundred floors—every retreat, every party, every loss—has led here. Kirito and Asuna remain at the heart of the fight, and the survivors who made it this far stand together. My choices did not replace theirs. They helped make a path wide enough for all of us.\n\nThe last gate opens. The system’s red light fades. Somewhere beyond this world, ten thousand people are about to wake. I look back once at the castle that tried to become our whole world, then step toward the light.`,choices:['Begin the final encounter.']};
if(s.storyKey==='afterBattle')return {title:'FIRST BLOOD',label:'FLOOR 1 · OUTER FIELD',text:`The Grey Wolf dissolves into blue polygons. For a moment I can hear only my own breathing. My hands are shaking—not because the fight was grand, but because it was real.\n\nA system message confirms the kill. The first step has been taken, and the path back to the city is still open. Beyond the rise, I catch a glimpse of a party moving in formation. Their leader’s red hair flashes in the sun. Maybe it was the same player from the plaza.\n\nWhat matters now is whether I keep going, and who I choose to become along the way.`,choices:['Return to the Starting City to recover and resupply.','Follow the party at a respectful distance.','Explore the nearby ruins; there may be a hidden cache.']};
if(s.storyKey==='town')return townScene();
if(s.storyKey==='questDone')return {title:'A SMALL VICTORY',label:`FLOOR ${s.floor} · ${esc(s.location.toUpperCase())}`,text:`A little experience, a few Col, and the memory of a difficult first fight. None of it makes me invincible. It does make the next step feel possible. The city is loud with rumors: a beta tester called Kirito has been marked a “beater” by the crowd, a new frontline group is forming, and the first boss is still somewhere at the top of a labyrinth.\n\nFor now, the adventure is local. I can train, prepare, or head back into the field.`,choices:['Check the town market and equipment stalls.','Rest at the inn, then return to the field.','Ask around for a side quest.','Head back out and search for another monster.']};
if(s.storyKey==='floorClear')return floorScene();
if(s.storyKey==='bossAfter')return {title:'THE GATE OPENS',label:`FLOOR ${s.floor} · BOSS DEFEATED`,text:`The boss’s final attack never comes. Its body breaks apart in a storm of light, and the gate behind it groans open. The players around me cheer, some crying, some too stunned to speak. Kirito lowers his blade; Asuna stands at his side, steady and unreadable until she catches his eye. They have their own history, their own choices. I am only one person among many who helped make this possible.\n\nBeyond the gate, the next floor waits. The castle has not become kinder. It has only given us another horizon.`,choices:['Cross the gate with the raid group.','Stay behind and help the injured players.','Speak with Kirito and Asuna before the group disperses.']};
return genericScene()}
function townScene(){let loc=floors[game.state.floor-1][0];return {title:`${loc.toUpperCase()} · SAFE ZONE`,label:`FLOOR ${game.state.floor} · TOWN`,text:`The safety of town is mostly an illusion, but the system’s blue boundary is a comfort I did not expect to need. Traders call out prices beneath canvas awnings. The blacksmith’s hammer rings steadily. Adventurers compare maps and keep one eye on the distant labyrinth.\n\n${game.state.floor===1?'At a table near the fountain, Klein waves when he spots me. “You made it back! Not bad for day one.”':'The town has grown familiar, though the faces change with every floor. A notice board carries local jobs, and the inn offers a place to restore strength.'} I can spend Col on supplies, improve my gear, take a small job, or get back to the field.`,choices:['Visit the blacksmith. Improve my weapon or armor.','Rest at the inn and recover HP and SP.','Take a local side quest from the notice board.','Leave town and continue exploring.']}}
function floorScene(){const s=game.state;const bossFloor=s.floor%5===0||s.floor===100;const choices=['Explore the frontier cautiously.','Find the town and gather information.','Look for a party forming near the gate.','Go straight to the labyrinth entrance (dangerous).'];if(bossFloor)choices.push(`Challenge ${floors[s.floor-1][4]} (boss raid).`);return {title:`FLOOR ${s.floor} · ${floors[s.floor-1][1].toUpperCase()}`,label:`THE FRONTIER · FLOOR ${s.floor}`,text:`The gate opens onto a new sky. Floor ${s.floor} spreads out in a landscape unlike the last: ${floors[s.floor-1][1].toLowerCase()}, with a town called ${floors[s.floor-1][0]} marked on the map. The labyrinth entrance rises beyond the wilderness, its stonework visible through the haze.\n\nThe first monsters here are stronger than the ones I faced before. I am not expected to conquer the floor alone, and no one is forcing me to. The frontier group needs scouts, crafters, and people who know when to retreat. I check my supplies and choose my next step.`,choices}}
function genericScene(){return {title:'THE ROAD AHEAD',label:`FLOOR ${game.state.floor} · ${game.state.location.toUpperCase()}`,text:'The wind moves through the grass. Somewhere ahead, the next piece of Aincrad waits, shaped by the decisions that brought me here. I take a breath and choose my direction.',choices:['Continue exploring.','Return to town.','Check my status and prepare.']}}
function renderStory(){const sc=scene();app.innerHTML=`${topbar()}<div class="story-head"><div><div class="event-label">${sc.label}</div><h1 class="title" style="font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,40px);margin:7px 0 0">${sc.title}</h1></div><span class="tag">${game.state.location}</span></div><div class="layout"><section class="main-col"><div class="panel"><div class="story-copy">${sc.text.split('\n\n').map(p=>`<p>${p}</p>`).join('')}</div><div class="choice-list">${sc.choices.map((c,i)=>`<button class="story-choice" onclick="choose(${i})"><span class="choice-num">0${i+1}</span><span>${c}</span></button>`).join('')}</div><div class="free-action"><input id="customAction" placeholder="Or describe your own action…" maxlength="140" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')customAction()"><button onclick="customAction()">ACT ↗</button></div><div class="divider"></div><div class="command-row">${['STATUS','INVENTORY','QUEST','JOURNAL','SAVE'].map(c=>`<button class="command-btn" onclick="command('${c}')">${c}</button>`).join('')}</div></div>${game.state.battleLog?`<div class="panel"><div class="panel-heading">Latest report <b>FIELD LOG</b></div><div class="log">${esc(game.state.battleLog)}</div></div>`:''}</section><aside class="side-col"><div class="panel side-panel"><div class="panel-heading">PLAYER STATUS <b>LV ${game.state.level}</b></div>${statusBars()}<div class="mini-grid">${[['STR',game.state.str],['AGI',game.state.agi],['VIT',game.state.vit],['DEX',game.state.dex],['DEF',game.state.def],['COL',game.state.col]].map(x=>`<div class="mini-stat">${x[0]}<b>${x[1]}</b></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="stat-list"><div class="stat-line"><span>WEAPON</span><b>${esc(game.state.weapon)}</b></div><div class="stat-line"><span>PROFICIENCY</span><b>${game.state.proficiency}%</b></div><div class="stat-line"><span>EXP</span><b>${game.state.exp} / ${game.state.nextExp}</b></div></div></div><div class="panel side-panel"><div class="panel-heading">CURRENT QUEST <b>${game.state.quests.some(q=>q.state==='Active')?'ACTIVE':'CLEAR'}</b></div>${game.state.quests.filter(q=>q.state==='Active').slice(0,1).map(q=>`<div class="quest-card"><h3>${esc(q.title)}</h3><p>${esc(q.desc)}</p><div class="quest-state">${q.state} · ${q.reward}</div></div>`).join('')||'<p class="side-copy">No active quests. Ask around town for work.</p>'}<div class="panel-heading" style="margin:20px 0 6px">RECENT EVENTS <b>LOG</b></div><div class="log">${game.state.journal.slice(-3).reverse().map(x=>`<div class="log-entry">${esc(x)}</div>`).join('')}</div></div><div class="panel side-panel floor-panel"><div class="floor-art"><span class="sun"></span><span class="mountain"></span><span class="mountain two"></span><span class="city"></span></div><div class="eyebrow">THE FLOATING CASTLE</div><h2 class="side-title">Floor ${game.state.floor}<span style="color:var(--gold)"> / 100</span></h2><p class="side-copy">${esc(floors[game.state.floor-1]?.[1]||'Unknown frontier')} · ${esc(floors[game.state.floor-1]?.[0]||'Town')}</p></div></aside></div>`}
function statusBars(){const s=game.state;return `<div class="bar-label"><span>HP</span><span>${s.hp} / ${s.maxHp}</span></div><div class="bar"><span style="width:${100*s.hp/s.maxHp}%"></span></div><div class="bar-label"><span>SP</span><span>${s.sp} / ${s.maxSp}</span></div><div class="bar sp"><span style="width:${100*s.sp/s.maxSp}%"></span></div>`}
function persist(){if(game.state){localStorage.setItem(SAVE_KEY,JSON.stringify({state:game.state,mode:'story'}))}}
function load(){const raw=localStorage.getItem(SAVE_KEY);if(!raw){toast('No save data found in this browser.');return}try{const d=JSON.parse(raw);game.state=d.state;game.mode='story';game.combat=null;game.state.flags=game.state.flags||{};game.state.quests=game.state.quests||[];game.state.inventory=game.state.inventory||[];render();toast('SAVE DATA loaded. Welcome back.')}catch(e){toast('Save data could not be read.')}}
function save(){if(!game.state){toast('Create a character before saving.');return}persist();toast('SAVE DATA updated in this browser.')}
function command(c){if(c==='SAVE'){save();return}if(c==='LOAD'){load();return}if(!game.state){toast('Create a character first.');return}if(c==='STATUS')modalStatus();else if(c==='INVENTORY')modalInventory();else if(c==='QUEST')modalQuest();else if(c==='JOURNAL')modalJournal()}
function modal(title,html){let old=document.querySelector('.modal-backdrop');if(old)old.remove();document.body.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',`<div class="modal-backdrop" onclick="if(event.target===this)this.remove()"><div class="modal"><div class="panel-heading"><span>AINCRAD SYSTEM</span><button class="command-btn" onclick="this.closest('.modal-backdrop').remove()">CLOSE ✕</button></div><h2>${title}</h2><div class="modal-content">${html}</div></div></div>`)}
function modalStatus(){const s=game.state;modal('Character status',`<div class="subtle">${esc(s.name)} · ${esc(s.profile.age)} · ${esc(s.profile.gender)} · Floor ${s.floor}</div><div class="divider"></div>${statusBars()}<div class="stat-list">${[['Level',s.level],['EXP',`${s.exp} / ${s.nextExp}`],['STR',s.str],['AGI',s.agi],['VIT',s.vit],['DEX',s.dex],['DEF',s.def],['Weapon proficiency',`${s.proficiency}%`],['Skill mastery',`${s.mastery}%`],['Col',s.col],['Location',s.location],['Party',s.party.length?s.party.join(', '):'Solo']].map(([a,b])=>`<div class="stat-line"><span>${a}</span><b>${esc(b)}</b></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="divider"></div><div><b>Appearance:</b> ${esc(s.profile.appearance||'Not specified')}<br><b>Personality:</b> ${esc(s.profile.personality)}<br><b>Background:</b> ${esc(s.profile.background)}<br><b>Hope:</b> ${esc(s.profile.hope||'Not specified')}</div>`)}
function modalInventory(){const s=game.state;let inv=s.inventory;modal('Inventory & equipment',`<div class="stat-line"><span>Col currency</span><b>${s.col} Col</b></div><div class="item-row"><div><div class="item-name">${esc(s.weapon)} <span class="tag">EQUIPPED</span></div><div class="item-info">ATK +${s.weaponDamage} · ${s.proficiency}% proficiency</div></div><span class="subtle">MAIN HAND</span></div><div class="item-row"><div><div class="item-name">${esc(s.armor)} <span class="tag">EQUIPPED</span></div><div class="item-info">DEF +${s.armorDef}</div></div><span class="subtle">BODY</span></div>${inv.length?inv.map((it,i)=>`<div class="item-row"><div><div class="item-name">${esc(it.name)} <span class="subtle">×${it.count}</span></div><div class="item-info">${esc(it.info)}</div></div>${it.type==='consumable'?`<button class="item-action" onclick="useItem(${i})">USE</button>`:''}</div>`).join(''):'<p>Empty.</p>'}`)}
function modalQuest(){modal('Quest log',`${game.state.quests.map(q=>`<div class="quest-card"><h3>${esc(q.title)}</h3><p>${esc(q.desc)}</p><div class="quest-state">${esc(q.state)} · Reward: ${esc(q.reward)}</div></div>`).join('')||'<p>No quests recorded.</p>'}<div class="divider"></div><p>Tip: side quests can be discovered in towns or through exploration. Major floor quests appear as you advance.</p>`)}
function modalJournal(){modal('Journal',`<div>${game.state.journal.map((x,i)=>`<div class="log-entry"><span class="subtle">ENTRY ${String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><br>${esc(x)}</div>`).join('')}</div>`)}
function useItem(i){const it=game.state.inventory[i];if(!it||it.count<1)return;if(it.name==='Healing Potion'){if(game.state.hp===game.state.maxHp){toast('HP is already full.');return}const n=Math.min(35,game.state.maxHp-game.state.hp);game.state.hp+=n;toast(`Restored ${n} HP.`)}else if(it.name==='Minor SP Tonic'){if(game.state.sp===game.state.maxSp){toast('SP is already full.');return}const n=Math.min(18,game.state.maxSp-game.state.sp);game.state.sp+=n;toast(`Restored ${n} SP.`)}else{toast('Rations are best used during a rest.');return}it.count--;if(it.count===0)game.state.inventory.splice(i,1);persist();document.querySelector('.modal-backdrop')?.remove();modalInventory();render()}
function choose(i){const s=game.state;if(!s)return;const sc=scene();const choice=sc.choices[i];if(!choice)return;s.decisions.push({floor:s.floor,scene:s.storyKey,choice});if(s.storyKey==='ending'){s.journal.push('Reached Floor 100 in this AU campaign.');s.storyKey='floorClear';s.floor=100;s.location='Aincrad summit';persist();render();toast('The final chapter awaits.');return}else if(s.storyKey==='opening'){if(i===0){s.relationships.Klein+=1;s.storyKey='afterIntro';s.journal.push('After Kayaba’s announcement, I pushed through the crowd toward the gate.');}else if(i===1){s.relationships.Asuna+=1;s.storyKey='afterIntro';s.journal.push('I searched for the red-haired player, but the crowd swallowed her.');}else if(i===2){s.relationships.Kirito+=1;s.storyKey='afterIntro';s.journal.push('I found the quiet black-haired player, Kirito, already mapping a route to the gate.');}else{s.relationships.Klein+=1;s.storyKey='afterIntro';s.hp=Math.min(s.maxHp,s.hp+4);s.journal.push('I helped calm a panicked player in the plaza.');}}
else if(s.storyKey==='afterIntro'){if(i===0){s.relationships.Klein+=2;s.party=['Klein'];s.journal.push('I joined Klein’s small group for the first trip outside.');s.storyKey='firstField';}else if(i===1){s.relationships.Kirito+=1;s.journal.push('I headed out alone, following Kirito’s example.');s.storyKey='firstField';}else if(i===2){s.storyKey='town';s.journal.push('I checked the item stalls before venturing out.');render();return;}else{s.relationships.Asuna+=1;s.journal.push('I asked about the red-haired player. No one knew her name yet.');s.storyKey='firstField';}}else if(s.storyKey==='firstField'){if(i===0){startCombat('Grey Wolf',1);return}else if(i===1){s.journal.push('I studied the Grey Wolf’s pattern before it could close in.');s.dex+=1;startCombat('Grey Wolf',1);return}else{s.storyKey='town';s.journal.push('I chose not to risk a fight before I was ready.');render();return}}else if(s.storyKey==='afterBattle'){if(i===0){s.storyKey='town';s.journal.push('I returned to town to recover and resupply.');}else if(i===1){s.relationships.Asuna+=1;s.journal.push('I followed the distant frontline party and spotted Asuna among them.');s.storyKey='questDone';}else{s.storyKey='questDone';s.journal.push('I searched the nearby ruins for a hidden cache.');if(Math.random()<.65){s.col+=25;s.inventory.push({name:'Old Coin',type:'misc',count:1,info:'A tarnished coin from a forgotten floor-1 ruin.'});s.journal.push('I found an old coin worth 25 Col.');}}}else if(s.storyKey==='town'){if(i===0){openBlacksmith();return}else if(i===1){s.hp=s.maxHp;s.sp=s.maxSp;s.storyKey='questDone';s.journal.push('I rested at the inn and recovered fully.');}else if(i===2){offerQuest();return}else{s.storyKey='firstField';s.journal.push('I left town and returned to the outer field.');}}else if(s.storyKey==='questDone'){if(i===0){s.storyKey='town';}else if(i===1){s.hp=Math.min(s.maxHp,s.hp+18);s.sp=Math.min(s.maxSp,s.sp+10);s.storyKey='firstField';}else if(i===2){offerQuest();return}else{s.storyKey='fir