40: if(s.storyKey==='bossAfter')return {title:'THE GATE OPENS',label:`FLOOR ${s.floor} · BOSS DEFEATED`,text:`The boss’s final attack never comes. Its body breaks apart in a storm of light, and the gate behind it groans open. The players around me cheer, some crying, some too stunned to speak. Kirito lowers his blade; Asuna stands at his side, steady and unreadable until she catches his eye. They have their own history, their own choices. I am only one person among many who helped make this possible.\n\nBeyond the gate, the next floor waits. The castle has not become kinder. It has only given us another horizon.`,choices:['Cross the gate with the raid group.','Stay behind and help the injured players.','Speak with Kirito and Asuna before the group disperses.']};
